# Cid's Secret (bastok 26), the importantEvent of Cid's 502 (Prog 0) and 508 (Prog 1), against a rival at Cid: Bastok
# mission 2-1 The Crystal Line current at status 0, whose Cid trigger is progressEvent(505) (Progress, 1000). Cid's list
# has the missions' containers before the quests' (Mission[1][3] before Quest[1][26]), and Cid has no NPC script (no
# fallback). importantEvent puts 502 at Progress (1000) until it plays, then at Event (100): the first talk ties 505
# and 502 at 1000 and plays the first, 505 (the cycle's var on it); 505 declined (option 1: the status stays 0, no
# crystal); the second talk ties them again and the cycle plays the next, 502, which drops to Event; the third and
# the fourth: 505 alone. Without importantEvent 502 never ties (Event 100 under 1000): 505 at every talk; as a plain
# Progress it ties at every talk, the cycle 505, 502, 505, 502. Then Prog 1 (GM) and a rezone (the char's local vars,
# the cycle's and the priority's, cleared): 508 the same way.
char zone=Metalworks pos=-14,-11,0
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine current
quest Bastok.CidsSecret accepted
login
trigger Cid                    # Prog 0: 505 and 502 tie at Progress: 505, the first in the list
finish option=1                # declined: the status stays 0
trigger Cid                    # the tie again: the cycle's next, 502 (importantEvent: now at Event)
finish
trigger Cid                    # 505 alone
finish option=1
trigger Cid                    # 505 alone again (a Progress 502 would tie: the cycle's next, 502)
finish option=1
charvar Quest[1][26]Prog 1     # GM: Prog 1
rezone                         # the local vars cleared
trigger Cid                    # Prog 1: 505 and 508 tie: 505
finish option=1
trigger Cid                    # the cycle's next: 508 (now at Event)
finish
trigger Cid                    # 505 alone
finish option=1
trigger Cid                    # 505 alone again
finish option=1
